# r1113 chunk 3, boot B1: group B fresh normal world, seed 8675309 (prep_srv default), full pack.
# Server: bash tools/scratch_query/prep_srv.sh OUT c3b1 B difficulty=normal
# Before boot: copy tools/scratch_query/c3_probe.js, zp_probe.js, zact_probe.js into OUT/srv/kubejs/server_scripts/ as
#   zz_c3_probe.js, zz_zp_probe.js, zz_zact_probe.js. No config edit (c3_b2.qb is the control boot for SQ-FCK-07 / -08).
# Rows: SQ-ENGM-01 to -04 (fresh world, full pack), SQ-CBP-11, SQ-CDW-02, SQ-IDS-01, -02, SQ-CIF-02 (after half),
# SQ-CIF-03, SQ-MIN-07, SQ-FCK-07, SQ-FCK-08, SQ-HSC-89. The seed's spawn is ocean (r1106 note): every land row locates
# its biome first (capture) and forceloads a box there; boxes are released after their count.
# Not here: SQ-IDS-02 `/cdevgen run food_dict` (srv/ has no tools/: the generator would fail; never point it at the
#   instance) and the perf suite smoke; SQ-ENGM-04 Ore Excavation undo (needs the client key); SQ-CIF-02 old chest.
pace 1

## SQ-C3B-setup | gamerules, spawn platform, bot (not a test row)
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> time set noon
> weather clear
> forceload add 0 0
> setblock 0 199 0 minecraft:stone
> setblock 0 199 2 minecraft:stone
> pbot spawn cb 0.5 200 0.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> zc3 bstate 0 199 0
expect bstate 0 199 0 Block\{minecraft:stone\}

## SQ-ENGM-01 | Done; no mixin or moved-class error; Worldgen and Equipment mod data packs lines
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
bootreject ClassNotFoundException.*com\.SaintAlfonzo
bootreject CEConfig not on classpath|NCH.*not on classpath
bootexpect \[creativeworldgen\] mod data packs on: \[(?=.*farmersdelight)(?=.*fungidelight)(?=.*miners_delight)(?=.*upgrade_aquatic)(?=.*vintagedelight)
bootexpect \[creativeequipment\] mod data packs on: \[.*felsic_gear
shell grep -hE "mod data packs|NCH.*not on classpath|CEConfig" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-250
shell grep -cE "Mixing [A-Za-z_.]*(creativecompat|creativemagic|creativeengineering)" logs/latest.log
look Worldgen's line also has biomesoplenty now (its pack folder exists since the row was written); the mixin count is for the record

## SQ-CDW-02 | all mods present: wild crop packs line off none, no skip line; rubber trees near a jungle
bootexpect \[creativedelight\] wild crop worldgen packs on: \[.*\]; off \(mod not loaded\): none
kjsreject \[wild-crops\].*mod not loaded, skipped
shell grep -h "wild crop worldgen packs" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-300
shell grep -h "\[wild-crops\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200 | head -6
> locate biome minecraft:jungle
waitlog nearest minecraft:jungle is at|Could not find 300
capture JG minecraft:jungle is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]

> forceload add {JG1-80} {JG3-80} {JG1+79} {JG3+79}
sleep 90
> zq count {JG1-80} 50 {JG3-80} {JG1+79} 160 {JG3+79} myrtrees:rubberwood_log
waitlog \[zq\] count myrtrees:rubberwood_log: \d+ 600
expect \[zq\] count myrtrees:rubberwood_log: [1-9]
> forceload remove {JG1-80} {JG3-80} {JG1+79} {JG3+79}
look packs line lists delightful, enders_additions, ends_delight, farmersdelight, fruitsdelight, fungidelight, hearthandharvest, myrtrees, oceanic_delight (a newer jar may add packs); rubberwood logs in about 1 chunk in 4 of the 10x10 box (log count / about 5 logs a tree).

## SQ-CBP-11 | transitions moved to Equipment (37); felsic_gear pack on; no incomplete or duplicate error; felsic ore in End highlands; block drops 2-4 scrap
shell grep -hE "transition items|end gear transition|mod data packs" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/latest.log | cut -c1-200
shell grep -qE "\[creativeequipment\] end gear transition items \(37\)" logs/kubejs/startup.log
bootreject incomplete\('[^']*'\) not registered
bootreject (Duplicate|duplicate).*kubejs:incomplete_
> datapack list
waitlog data packs? enabled 30
expect felsic_gear
> zq bytype create:sequenced_assembly
waitlog \[zq\] bytype create:sequenced_assembly: \d+ 60
> execute in minecraft:the_end run locate biome minecraft:end_highlands
waitlog nearest minecraft:end_highlands is at|Could not find 300
capture EH minecraft:end_highlands is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload add {EH1-40} {EH3-40} {EH1+39} {EH3+39}
sleep 60
> zq count {EH1-40} 0 {EH3-40} {EH1+39} 120 {EH3+39} felsic_gear:felsic_block minecraft:the_end
waitlog \[zq\] count felsic_gear:felsic_block: \d+ 300
expect \[zq\] count felsic_gear:felsic_block: [1-9]
> execute in minecraft:the_end run forceload remove {EH1-40} {EH3-40} {EH1+39} {EH3+39}
> setblock 0 200 2 felsic_gear:felsic_block
> zact break 0 200 2 minecraft:netherite_pickaxe
waitlog \[zact\] done 20
expect \[zact\] break.*creativeequipment:felsic_scrap x[2-4]\b
look Engineering's own transition count is 67 in the 11-12 pack log (37 lower than before the move); Equipment 37; data pack list shows the felsic_gear pack enabled; felsic scrap id is creativeequipment:felsic_scrap. If the ore is a different block than felsic_gear:felsic_block, count 0 is a batch fault: read the pack's placed feature

## SQ-IDS-01 | owner-id lint 0 flagged; no duplicate WTHIT plugin or JEI uid line
