## SQ-ENGM-02 | creativeworldgen packs listed; sky island locatable; driftwood, morels, cave carrots present near spawn
> datapack list
waitlog data packs? enabled 30
expect creativeworldgen
> locate structure creativeworldgen:sky_island
waitlog (nearest creativeworldgen:sky_island|Could not find) 300
> locate structure creativeworldgen:waystone_ruin_part
waitlog (nearest creativeworldgen:waystone_ruin_part|Could not find|no structure|Unknown|Invalid) 300
> locate biome terralith:scarlet_mountains
waitlog (nearest terralith:scarlet_mountains|Could not find) 300
> forceload add -80 -80 79 79
sleep 60
> zq count -80 50 -80 79 120 79 upgrade_aquatic:driftwood_log
waitlog \[zq\] count upgrade_aquatic:driftwood_log: \d+ 300
> zq count -80 -64 -80 79 120 79 fungidelight:morel_mushroom
waitlog \[zq\] count fungidelight:morel_mushroom: \d+ 300
> zq count -80 -64 -80 79 60 79 miners_delight:wild_cave_carrots
waitlog \[zq\] count miners_delight:wild_cave_carrots: \d+ 300
> forceload remove -80 -80 79 79
look sky island located (ids are creativeworldgen: since the Worldgen carve; the row's creativeengineering: ids are gone); the waystone ruin is a meta structure (its part is the only registered structure: a "Could not find" is not a FAIL, use /cdevplace later); Scarlet Mountains is an Overworld Terralith biome (the row's Nether execute is wrong); the counts near spawn (mostly ocean) are for the record against SQ-WGE / SQ-CDW census numbers: driftwood > 0 expected on this ocean spawn

## SQ-ENGM-03 | TNT shrapnel spawns (Compat); torch and seed milling recipes under creativedelight:; tags filled; wooden bucket recipe
> setblock 0 210 0 minecraft:stone
pace 0
> summon minecraft:tnt 0 211 0 {Fuse:1}
sleep 0.4
> kill @e[type=creativecompat:shrapnel]
pace 1
expect Killed [1-9]\d* entit|Killed .*[Ss]hrapnel
> zq recipes creativedelight:shaped/torch_crafting_animal_fat
waitlog \[zq\] recipes matching creativedelight:shaped/torch_crafting_animal_fat: 1 30
> zq recipes creativedelight:createmilling/seeds_bone_meal
waitlog \[zq\] recipes matching creativedelight:createmilling/seeds_bone_meal: 1 30
> zq itemtag creativedelight:millable_seeds
waitlog \[zq\] itemtag creativedelight:millable_seeds \(\d+\) 30
shell python3 -c "import json;d=json.load(open('$INST/kubejs/exported/tags/item_tags.json'));v=d.get('creativedelight:millable_seeds',[]);print('pack dump millable_seeds',len(v))"
> zq itemtag vinery:barrel
> zq itemtag forge:mulch/green
waitlog \[zq\] itemtag forge:mulch/green \(\d+\) 30
expect itemtag vinery:barrel \([1-9]
expect itemtag forge:mulch/green \([1-9]
> zq makes creativedelight:wooden_bucket
waitlog \[zq\] makes creativedelight:wooden_bucket: [1-9] 30
look ids moved since the row: shrapnel is creativecompat:shrapnel, the seeds tag creativedelight:millable_seeds (row: creativeengineering:), the wooden bucket creativedelight:wooden_bucket; millable_seeds count equals the pack dump's (11-10). If no shrapnel is killed, the 0.4 s window may have been too long (shrapnel lifetime): rerun with `sleep 0.1` before judging

