## SQ-CIF-02 | Better Beacons potions under creativebrewing: mixes exist; drinking phantom_bane gives Better Beacons Phantom Bane
> zq potion creativebrewing:long_long_reach
waitlog \[zq\] potion creativebrewing:long_long_reach registered: 30
expect potion creativebrewing:long_long_reach registered: true
> zq potion creativebrewing:long_reach minecraft:redstone
waitlog \[zq\] done 30
expect creativebrewing:long_reach \+ minecraft:redstone -> minecraft:potion creativebrewing:long_long_reach
